      "created_at": "2015-04-10T19:47:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Isn't the Room card (the one covered by the Entry Point) considered to basically not exist whilst covered? Or is it just that it has no text (and could thus presumably still be destroyed by \"Destroy an environment card\" effects)? I've not played in the Freedom Tower for a while so I can't remember.</p>",
