    {
      "id": 139132,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-14T09:16:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kreistor\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9e8a1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kreistor:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have to disagee. Cards under cards are considered out of play and cannot be chosen as the targets of any effects. Since the Room is hidden, it cannot be destroyed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not true.</p>\n<p>Cards under cards are have no text but are still Hero/Villain/Environment cards. If you play a card that destroys an Villain card (as opposed to an Ongoing card) you could target one under e.g. Savage Mana.</p>\n<p>See [url=  <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773</a>  ]here[/url] and [url=  <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-answers-from-christopher-at-pax-4082\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-answers-from-christopher-at-pax-4082</a>]  here[/url]</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:15:48.174Z",
