      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"kreistor\"]\n I have to disagee. Cards under cards are considered out of play and cannot be chosen as the targets of any effects. Since the Room is hidden, it cannot be destroyed.  \n[/quote]\n \n\n Not true. \n\n Cards under cards are have no text but are still Hero/Villain/Environment cards. If you play a card that destroys an Villain card (as opposed to an Ongoing card) you could target one under e.g. Savage Mana. \n\n See [url=  https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773  ]here[/url] and [url=  https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-answers-from-christopher-at-pax-4082]  here[/url] \n",
