      "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nSelf-Destruct Countdown + Dominion + Terraforming = extra card draws, if you&#39;re careful!\n\n[/quote]\n\nAnd this could go bad if you&#39;re wrong\n\nand misorder the death of the throng\n\nif you let the countdown go last\n\nthen your hope will be past\n\nand the game will be over ere long\n\n&nbsp;\n\nBasically, you can destroy the cards under Self-Destruct Countdown before you destroy the countdown itself, but if you do then you will lose when the countdown notices that it&#39;s pile is empty and blows up.\n\nIt&#39;s even worse if you&#39;re destroying the environment using Terraforming, because even if you don&#39;t blow up (say you noticed at the last second, and destroyed the countdown before its last card), then Omnitron will play a card for every card it destroyed. &nbsp;If you destroy the countdown first then it&#39;s not a problem because it wasn&#39;t terraforming that destroyed the other cards, it was the countdown. &nbsp;But if you go the other way, then watch out!\n",
